world  catapult into a bucket

floor
  size      8 m
  friction  0.8, spinning 0.005, rolling 0.002

catapult
  is a          catapult
  pivot height  50 cm
  arm length    50 cm
  arm mass      300 g
  swings        from 0° to 36°
  spring        4.85 N·m/rad toward 90°
  damping       0.02 N·m·s/rad
  armature      0.01 kg·m²
  friction      0.8

ball
  is a      sphere 4 cm radius, 60 g
  rolls
  friction  0.8, spinning 0.01, rolling 0.004
  colour    orange
  moves     freely
  rests     on catapult.scoop base, at catapult.scoop base's near end

bucket
  is an     open box
  length    70 cm
  width     70 cm
  walls     40 cm
  bounce    dead
  friction  0.9
  colour    grey
  its base 3 m beyond ball

expect
  ball touches catapult
  ball touches bucket
  ball comes to rest in bucket
